sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Chargewire server
  C->>S: POST …/statements, Chargewire-Retain-Result: true
  S-->>C: statement document, result.retained: true, expires_at
  C->>S: GET …/result
  S--xC: connection drops after batch 4
  C->>S: GET …/result?from_batch=5
  S-->>C: 200 Arrow stream from batch 5 (the schema first)
  C->>S: GET …/result (read it again)
  S-->>C: 200 the whole result
  Note over S: expires_at passes
  C->>S: GET …/result
  S-->>C: 410 result_expired
